msgid "Muros y soportes"
msgstr "Walls and supports"

msgid "Robusta y lenta. Se especializa en mampostería y materiales duros; la corrosión de las rojas le abre camino."
msgstr "Sturdy and slow. Specialises in masonry and hard materials; the reds' corrosion clears its way."

msgid "Daño x3 contra muros y x1.5 contra resistentes; daño x0.35 a alimentos. Requiere devorar paredes."
msgstr "Damage x3 against walls and x1.5 against tough materials; x0.35 against food. Requires devouring walls."

